            "Mahatma Gandhi, Pingali Venkayya; Vijayawada",
            "Held on March 31 \u2013 April 1, 1921. Pingali Venkayya (from Bhatlapenumarru, Krishna district) presented his design of the National Flag (Red and Green bands) to Gandhi, who added white and the spinning charkha. Raised 1 crore rupees for Tilak Swaraj Fund."
