        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "AP exhibits a tropical semi-arid to tropical maritime climate (K\u00f6ppen classification: Aw and As). The state's climatic profile is shaped by the interaction of both the South-West (SW) and North-East (NE) monsoons:"
