          "North-East (Retreating) Monsoon (October \u2013 December): South coastal districts (Nellore, Prakasam, Tirupati, Bapatla) receive significant rainfall (up to 50\u201360% of their annual quota) from the NE monsoon. Tropical depressions forming in the southern Bay of Bengal frequently intensify into severe cyclonic storms striking coastal AP.",
