          "Q2. The massive Uranium mining and processing facility operated by UCIL in Andhra Pradesh is located at:\n(a) Mangampeta\n(b) Tummalapalle\n(c) Banganapalle\n(d) Cheyyeru\nCorrect Answer: (b) Tummalapalle [Explanation: Tummalapalle in Vemula mandal of YSR Kadapa district houses India's largest uranium deposit and processing plant, operated by the Uranium Corporation of India Limited (UCIL).]",
