          "Q4. What is the official State Animal of Andhra Pradesh?\n(a) Blackbuck (Krishna Jinka)\n(b) Indian Elephant\n(c) Wild Water Buffalo\n(d) Spotted Deer\nCorrect Answer: (a) Blackbuck (Krishna Jinka) [Explanation: The Blackbuck (Antilope cervicapra / Krishna Jinka) is the official State Animal of Andhra Pradesh.]",
          "Q5. Coringa Wildlife Sanctuary in Kakinada district hosts a globally significant population of which specialized wetland carnivore?\n(a) Snow Leopard\n(b) Fishing Cat (Prionailurus viverrinus)\n(c) Clouded Leopard\n(d) Red Panda\nCorrect Answer: (b) Fishing Cat (Prionailurus viverrinus) [Explanation: Coringa Wildlife Sanctuary's estuarine mangroves host one of the world's dense populations of the Fishing Cat, an endangered wetland feline that preys primarily on fish and crustaceans.]"
