          "Discuss the ecological crisis faced by Kolleru Lake wetland. Evaluate the environmental and livelihood outcomes of 'Operation Kolleru'. (APPSC Group-1 Mains, 10 Marks)\n-> Model Approach: Contextualize Kolleru Lake as India's largest freshwater lake and designated Ramsar site between Godavari and Krishna deltas; detail environmental degradation (illegal conversion of wetland into commercial aquaculture bunds, chemical pesticide/fertilizer inflow, weed proliferation like Eichhornia, loss of migratory bird habitats for Grey Pelicans); evaluate 'Operation Kolleru' (demolition of bunds in +5 contour under Supreme Court orders); discuss subsequent socio-economic friction (loss of aqua-farmer livelihoods, demands to downscale sanctuary to +3 contour); advocate balanced eco-tourism and regulated community-managed wetlands.",
