          "Andhra Pradesh's Institutional Pioneer (SSAAT): Andhra Pradesh created the Society for Social Audit, Accountability and Transparency (SSAAT)\u2014an autonomous civil society-led society recognized as India's gold standard. Trained village youth (Village Social Auditors) conduct physical door-to-door verification of wage disbursements, check job card entries, verify civil assets, and present findings in open public hearings (Panchayat Public Hearings) in the presence of government officials."
