          "Q2. Under the Information Technology Act, 2000, which national agency is designated as the nodal agency for responding to computer security incidents?\n(a) National Cyber Coordination Centre (NCCC)\n(b) Indian Computer Emergency Response Team (CERT-In)\n(c) National Critical Information Infrastructure Protection Centre (NCIIPC)\n(d) Defence Cyber Agency (DCA)\nCorrect Answer: (b) Indian Computer Emergency Response Team (CERT-In) [Explanation: Section 70B of the IT Act designates CERT-In as the national agency for cyber incident response, vulnerability reporting, and emergency coordination.]",
