          "Q2. Under the National Food Security Act (NFSA), 2013, what is the monthly foodgrain entitlement per person for beneficiaries belonging to Priority Households?\n(a) 3 kg\n(b) 5 kg\n(c) 7 kg\n(d) 10 kg\nCorrect Answer: (b) 5 kg [Explanation: Section 3(1) of the NFSA entitles every person belonging to Priority Households to receive 5 kg of foodgrains per person per month at subsidized/free rates.]",
