        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Logical Reasoning and Analytical Ability evaluate an aspirant's capacity to recognize valid deductive inferences, distinguish logical assumptions from unverified extrapolations, evaluate argument strength, and systematically resolve multi-variable spatial and arrangement puzzles common in civil administration decision-making."
