    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q5. Which Satavahana monarch issued the famous Prakrit anthology 'Gathasaptasati' (700 erotic and pastoral poems)?\n(a) Gautamiputra Satakarni\n(b) Hala\n(c) Yajna Sri Satakarni\n(d) Pulamavi II\nCorrect Answer: (b) Hala [Explanation: King Hala, the 17th Satavahana ruler, compiled the renowned Prakrit poetic anthology 'Gathasaptasati' (Gaha Sattasai).]"
