    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q1. Who among the following historic personalities first unfurled the Indian National Flag on foreign soil at the International Socialist Conference held in Stuttgart, Germany in 1907?\n(a) Lala Har Dayal\n(b) Madame Bhikaji Cama\n(c) Shyamji Krishna Varma\n(d) Virendranath Chattopadhyaya\nCorrect Answer: (b) Madame Bhikaji Cama [Explanation: Madame Bhikaji Cama boldly unfurled the precursor to the Indian tricolor flag in Stuttgart in 1907, demanding international recognition of India's freedom.]"
