    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q2. The first registered widow remarriage in the Telugu-speaking region of Andhra was conducted by Kandukuri Veeresalingam Pantulu on which historic date?\n(a) 15 August 1878\n(b) 11 December 1881\n(c) 2 October 1893\n(d) 12 January 1885\nCorrect Answer: (b) 11 December 1881 [Explanation: Kandukuri performed the first widow remarriage in Andhra on 11 December 1881 at Rajahmundry, marrying Gogulapati Sreeramulu to Gowramma.]"
