    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Which revolutionary hero courted martyrdom after a heroic 63-day hunger strike in Lahore Central Jail in 1929 demanding political prisoner rights for Indian revolutionaries?\n(a) Bhagat Singh\n(b) Jatin Das (Jatindra Nath Das)\n(c) Sukhdev\n(d) Batukeshwar Dutt\nCorrect Answer: (b) Jatin Das (Jatindra Nath Das) [Explanation: Jatin Das died on 13 September 1929 after an epic 63-day hunger strike in Lahore Jail, sparking massive national grief.]"
