    "subject_title": "History and Culture of India",
    "raw_text": "Q1. Amarajeevi Potti Sreeramulu attained martyrdom on 15 December 1952 following a historic fast-unto-death lasting how many days?\n(a) 45 days\n(b) 52 days\n(c) 58 days\n(d) 63 days\nCorrect Answer: (c) 58 days [Explanation: Potti Sreeramulu began his fast on 19 October 1952 and breathed his last on 15 December 1952, enduring an epic hunger strike of 58 days for a separate Andhra state.]"
