    "raw_text": "Q3. The historic Poona Pact of September 1932 was signed between Dr. B.R. Ambedkar and which nationalist leader on behalf of caste Hindus?\n(a) Mahatma Gandhi\n(b) Madan Mohan Malaviya\n(c) Jawaharlal Nehru\n(d) Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel\nCorrect Answer: (b) Madan Mohan Malaviya [Explanation: Because Mahatma Gandhi was observing an indefinite fast in Yerwada Jail, Pandit Madan Mohan Malaviya signed the Poona Pact on behalf of caste Hindus alongside Dr. B.R. Ambedkar.]"
