    "raw_text": "Q4. Which famous slogan was proclaimed by Netaji Subhas Chandra Bose upon assuming supreme leadership of the Indian National Army (INA) in Singapore in 1943?\n(a) Inquilab Zindabad\n(b) Dilli Chalo\n(c) Jai Jawan Jai Kisan\n(d) Vande Mataram\nCorrect Answer: (b) Dilli Chalo [Explanation: Netaji gave the historic battle cry 'Dilli Chalo' (March to Delhi) to inspire the soldiers of the Azad Hind Fauj in July 1943.]"
