    "topic_title": "Civil Society, Regulatory Bodies & Role of Civil Services in Democracy",
    "subject_title": "Indian Polity, Constitution and Governance",
    "raw_text": "Q1. Which Article of the Indian Constitution provides constitutional protection against arbitrary dismissal or removal of members of civil services of the Union or a State?\n(a) Article 309\n(b) Article 310\n(c) Article 311\n(d) Article 312\nCorrect Answer: (c) Article 311 [Explanation: Article 311 provides that no civil servant shall be dismissed, removed, or reduced in rank without an inquiry where they are informed of charges and given a reasonable opportunity of being heard.]"
