    "raw_text": "Q3. The Competition Commission of India (CCI) was established under which Act of Parliament to prevent practices having adverse effects on market competition?\n(a) Monopolies and Restrictive Trade Practices (MRTP) Act, 1969\n(b) Competition Act, 2002\n(c) Consumer Protection Act, 2019\n(d) Companies Act, 2013\nCorrect Answer: (b) Competition Act, 2002 [Explanation: The Competition Act, 2002 established the Competition Commission of India (CCI) to eliminate anti-competitive practices, promote fair competition, and protect consumers.]"
