    "subject_title": "Indian Polity, Constitution and Governance",
    "raw_text": "Q2. What is the maximum total financial penalty that the Central Information Commission (CIC) or State Information Commission (SIC) can impose on an errant Public Information Officer under Section 20 of the RTI Act?\n(a) \u20b910,000\n(b) \u20b925,000\n(c) \u20b950,000\n(d) \u20b91,00,000\nCorrect Answer: (b) \u20b925,000 [Explanation: Under Section 20(1), a penalty of \u20b9250 each day till the application is received or information is furnished can be imposed, up to a total maximum of \u20b925,000.]"
