    "topic_title": "Public Service Ethics: Codes of Conduct, Leadership Ethics, Anti-Corruption, Lokpal & Lokayukta",
    "subject_title": "Ethics in Public Service and Knowledge of Law",
    "raw_text": "Q2. The Central Vigilance Commission (CVC) was originally set up in 1964 following the recommendations of which high-level committee?\n(a) Gorwala Committee\n(b) Santhanam Committee\n(c) Sarkaria Commission\n(d) Kothari Commission\nCorrect Answer: (b) Santhanam Committee [Explanation: The Committee on Prevention of Corruption, chaired by K. Santhanam (1962\u20131964), recommended the establishment of the Central Vigilance Commission.]"
