    "subject_title": "Ethics in Public Service and Knowledge of Law",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Which of the following commodities is currently EXCLUDED from the levy of Goods and Services Tax (GST) in India?\n(a) Natural Gas and Petroleum Products\n(b) Textiles and Garments\n(c) Motor Vehicles\n(d) Mobile Phones and Electronics\nCorrect Answer: (a) Natural Gas and Petroleum Products [Explanation: Five petroleum products (petrol, diesel, crude, natural gas, ATF) and alcoholic liquor for human consumption remain outside the GST tax ambit, taxed under VAT and State excise.]"
