    "subject_title": "Ethics in Public Service and Knowledge of Law",
    "raw_text": "Q5. Wealth Tax in India was formally abolished in which Union Budget year and replaced with an additional surcharge on high-income earners?\n(a) Union Budget 2012\u201313\n(b) Union Budget 2015\u201316\n(c) Union Budget 2017\u201318\n(d) Union Budget 2020\u201321\nCorrect Answer: (b) Union Budget 2015\u201316 [Explanation: Wealth Tax was abolished in the Union Budget 2015\u201316 due to high collection costs and replaced with a 2% surcharge on super-rich individuals.]"
