    "subject_title": "Economy and Development of India and Andhra Pradesh",
    "raw_text": "Q3. The 'Bad Bank' established in India in 2021 to take over and resolve stressed non-performing assets above \u20b9500 crore from commercial banks is formally named:\n(a) State Asset Reconstruction Agency (SARA)\n(b) National Asset Reconstruction Company Limited (NARCL)\n(c) Bharat Resolution Corporation (BRC)\n(d) Public Sector Asset Trust (PSAT)\nCorrect Answer: (b) National Asset Reconstruction Company Limited (NARCL) [Explanation: NARCL was incorporated in July 2021 as the designated bad bank to aggregate stressed assets above \u20b9500 crore from public sector banks.]"
