    "raw_text": "Q1. At the COP26 Climate Summit in Glasgow (2021), Prime Minister Narendra Modi committed India to achieving Net-Zero greenhouse gas emissions by which target year?\n(a) 2050\n(b) 2060\n(c) 2070\n(d) 2080\nCorrect Answer: (c) 2070 [Explanation: India pledged at COP26 to achieve net-zero carbon emissions by the year 2070 as part of its Panchamrit commitments.]"
