    "subject_title": "Science, Technology and Environment",
    "raw_text": "Q2. The National Green Tribunal (NGT) was established in 2010 under which constitutional provision giving effect to the right to a healthy environment?\n(a) Article 14\n(b) Article 19(1)(a)\n(c) Article 21\n(d) Article 32\nCorrect Answer: (c) Article 21 [Explanation: The NGT was enacted to provide effective judicial relief in environmental matters, drawing constitutional legitimacy from Article 21 (Protection of life and personal liberty, interpreted to encompass a healthy environment).]"
