    "subject_title": "Science, Technology and Environment",
    "raw_text": "Q3. The Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework adopted at COP15 of the CBD set which flagship target to protect 30% of the world's land and oceans by 2030?\n(a) 20x20 Target\n(b) 30x30 Target\n(c) 50x50 Target\n(d) Zero Extinction Target\nCorrect Answer: (b) 30x30 Target [Explanation: Target 3 of the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework (GBF) is known as the '30x30 target'\u2014aiming to conserve at least 30% of terrestrial, inland water, and coastal/marine areas by 2030.]"
