    "subject_title": "Science, Technology and Environment",
    "raw_text": "Q4. Under the Disaster Management Act, 2005, who serves as the ex-officio Chairperson of the District Disaster Management Authority (DDMA)?\n(a) Superintendent of Police\n(b) District Collector / District Magistrate\n(c) Mayor of the District Headquarters\n(d) Zilla Parishad Chairperson\nCorrect Answer: (b) District Collector / District Magistrate [Explanation: Section 25 of the DM Act 2005 provides that the District Collector/District Magistrate/Deputy Commissioner shall be the Chairperson of the DDMA.]"
