    "raw_text": "Q3. Which was the first Genetically Modified (GM) food crop approved by the Genetic Engineering Appraisal Committee (GEAC) for commercial cultivation in India, currently under Supreme Court scrutiny?\n(a) Bt Brinjal\n(b) Golden Rice\n(c) GM Mustard (DMH-11)\n(d) Flavr Savr Tomato\nCorrect Answer: (c) GM Mustard (DMH-11) [Explanation: Dhara Mustard Hybrid-11 (DMH-11) was approved by GEAC in October 2022 for environmental release, making it the first transgenic food crop to receive such clearance in India.]"
