    "raw_text": "Q5. Which famous coffee produced by tribal farmers in the Eastern Ghats of Andhra Pradesh holds a registered Geographical Indication (GI) tag?\n(a) Monsooned Malabar Coffee\n(b) Araku Valley Arabica Coffee\n(c) Coorg Arabica Coffee\n(d) Wayanad Robusta Coffee\nCorrect Answer: (b) Araku Valley Arabica Coffee [Explanation: Araku Valley Arabica Coffee grown in the Visakhapatnam/Alluri Sitharama Raju district of Andhra Pradesh was granted the GI tag in 2019.]"
