    "topic_title": "Number System, Divisibility Rules & Order of Magnitude",
    "subject_title": "General Mental and Psychological Abilities",
    "raw_text": "Q5. An order of magnitude comparison: How many times larger is 10^12 (Tera) compared to 10^6 (Mega)?\n(a) 10^2 times\n(b) 10^4 times\n(c) 10^6 times\n(d) 10^8 times\nCorrect Answer: (c) 10^6 times [Explanation: 10^12 / 10^6 = 10^(12-6) = 10^6 (one million times larger).]"
